## Format example (commented out - copy, rename, and uncomment to activate)

```yaml
# schedule: daily 08:00
# gather: scripts/gather-template.sh
# condition: threshold count > 0
# prompt: scheduled-tasks/example-prompt.md
# model: sonnet
# budget: 1
# criticality: normal
```

